>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYLEDGER.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-LINE PIC X(512).
01 DEBIT-TEXT PIC X(24).
01 CREDIT-TEXT PIC X(24).
01 EXPECTED-ROWS-TEXT PIC X(12).
01 ACTUAL-ROWS-TEXT PIC X(12).
01 DEBIT-CENTS PIC 9(14) VALUE 0.
01 CREDIT-CENTS PIC 9(14) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-LINE
    UNSTRING INPUT-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO DEBIT-TEXT CREDIT-TEXT EXPECTED-ROWS-TEXT ACTUAL-ROWS-TEXT
    END-UNSTRING
    COMPUTE DEBIT-CENTS = FUNCTION NUMVAL(DEBIT-TEXT)
    COMPUTE CREDIT-CENTS = FUNCTION NUMVAL(CREDIT-TEXT)
    IF DEBIT-CENTS >= CREDIT-CENTS
        DISPLAY "LEDGER_OK"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "LEDGER_UNBALANCED"
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
